WEBVTT

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:00.640
Akutagawa Ryunosuke took on the masses with his artistic literature.

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:04.690
<b>Host
Sakai Masato</b>

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.770
However, he was faced with days of agony in mid-Taisho era.

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.940
Agony

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.360
Back then, first-person narrative novels based on one's own experiences became popular.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.490
One's own experiences

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:17.780
Akutagawa's works, being based off of old books and western literature,

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:18.030
started being criticized as "made-up" or "fake".

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:19.040
"Made-up"

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.290
"Fake"

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:21.500
In a desperate attempt to
keep up with the times,

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.120
<b>Akutagawa Ryunosuke</b>

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.830
Akutagawa wrote a novel
based on his experiences.

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:29.630
However, it wasn't as well-
received as his previous works.
<b>Akutagawa Ryunosuke</b>

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.760
On July 24 of 1927, Akutagawa Ryunosuke committed suicide.

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:35.470
Suicide

00:00:35.470 --> 00:00:40.770
His suicide note stated, "a hazy uneasiness toward my future".

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:42.560
The representative work of a man at the halfway point of his life

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.020
A work representing the middle of Akutagawa's life, published in 1918.
Hell Screen

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.650
is this, <i>Hell Screen</i>.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:46.690
This story, which portrays a man who sacrifices everything for art,

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:47.230
HELL SCREEN

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.520
Sacrifices

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:49.770
HELL SCREEN

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.610
might have also been hinting at
the future of Akutagawa himself.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:53.650
Hinting

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:54.490
HELL SCREEN
Hinting

00:00:54.490 --> 00:00:54.650
The masterpieces are blue.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:57.370
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.490
Please enjoy <i>Hell Screen</i>.

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:31.940
HELL SCREEN

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:51.380
How splendid.

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:56.380
I have yet to see any other portrait as beautiful as this.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:03.560
You portrayed my beauty to even the last strands of hair when it was said that it couldn't be portrayed.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:06.560
You are certainly the best artist under the sky.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:08.560
I praise thee, Yoshihide.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:11.650
It is of the highest honor.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:18.820
It is a splendid work, truly worthy of a
country such as ours that holds much glory.

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:24.160
An idea, Yoshihide.

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.950
I shall have you paint something much greater next.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.210
Much greater?

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:32.840
It is a grand work perfect for your talent.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:36.960
Paint every scenery of this magnificent country that is—

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.890
What is the matter?

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:46.060
Help me!

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.310
Quiet down!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.940
The King is in the midst of his banquet.

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:54.270
Help me!

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:55.570
Insolent!

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:57.650
Keep your dirty hands off.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.200
How could they do that?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.280
Move!

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:04.830
That's terrible.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.290
What is the trouble?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:08.910
They are interfering with my party.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.710
Why don't you cut off their heads?

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:13.290
No...

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.480
That was terrible.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:42.360
They did nothing wrong.

00:03:53.460 --> 00:03:54.460
Mitsuki.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:04:00.170
I have long served the lord of this country,

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.800
but from time to time I bear
the feeling of disgust in my heart.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:07.050
Father?

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:14.350
The King always demands a painting of a graceful noble or of the elegant scenery...

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.320
Yet I don't understand a single bit.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:22.650
I don't understand the King's beauty.

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.070
I don't understand this country's beauty.

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:27.870
I do not understand any of it.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:32.910
Father...

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:35.710
Mitsuki.

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:39.550
I may not be able to paint the work he demands.

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:49.390
And if that were to happen,
my next job may become my final job.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:10.490
Thank you for coming, Yoshihide.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.500
I summoned you here for only one reason.

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:20.710
'Tis to give you yet another
opportunity to put your skills to work.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.420
We will talk inside.

00:05:25.420 --> 00:05:27.640
I cannot stand the dirty air here.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.100
Open!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.410
Yoshihide.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.040
Is this not splendid?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:56.000
Behold this magnificent, graceful figure.

00:05:56.000 --> 00:06:00.500
This is the holy mausoleum in which my corpse will rest.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:07.720
I had planned to decorate the place with
various treasures on the dawn of completion,

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:09.970
but I changed my mind.

00:06:10.550 --> 00:06:12.760
I order thee, Yoshihide.

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:16.560
Paint my country on the inner walls of this tomb.

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:20.810
The bewitching people...

00:06:20.810 --> 00:06:22.900
The beautiful city.

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:25.190
This gorgeous world.

00:06:25.190 --> 00:06:26.900
Paint them all as they are.

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:33.200
So that even after I depart,
I will continue to rule over this land.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.250
This whole country?

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:54.470
Yes, sir.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:07:00.940
I, Yoshihide, will present you the greatest work to the utmost of my abilities.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.230
Out of the way!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:09.740
Bring the fire! Bring the fire!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.570
It's the plague! Burn them!

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.030
Open! Open! Open!

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:17.540
Move! Move! Move! Move!

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.430
Father!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.140
Where are you?

00:07:56.950 --> 00:07:58.740
Back away! Back away!

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:13.630
You murderer!

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:16.140
She was still alive!

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.300
You murderer!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:20.220
Silence, you beggar!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:24.660
It's a human pillar.

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:26.870
Father?

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.750
They probably buried live humans to strengthen the walls.

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.670
Or...

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:38.640
Perhaps it was a warning to all the slaves who work here.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.100
So cruel...

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.100
Mitsuki.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.480
Look.

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:52.110
This...

00:09:56.150 --> 00:10:00.990
This... is the true face of this world.

00:11:03.260 --> 00:11:09.350
At long last, the construction has finished.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.230
Now...

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:13.480
Yes.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:15.150
Yoshihide.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.010
What is this painting?

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:43.930
I ordered you to paint my country.

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.560
This is but a hell screen!

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.520
An interesting way to put it.

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:55.060
This is the true face of this country.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:12:01.110
This is the greatest work I, Yoshihide, have completed in my lifetime.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.570
Girl!

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:05.910
Why do you not stop him?

00:12:05.910 --> 00:12:08.990
This is a sacred place that will bury me!

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:11.370
This is an insult toward <i>me</i> !

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.000
Treason!

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.080
You have sinned too!

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:22.380
Then take the head of my sinful self
and wash my corpse away to the river.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:27.430
Bury me alive into this wall to
warn others not to commit treason.

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:34.310
The painting shows the truth of
what Yoshihide saw with his own eyes.

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:38.480
Just the painting you have demanded.

00:12:40.030 --> 00:12:46.160
Since Yoshihide, the greatest artist under the sky,
claimed this to be his utmost work,

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:51.080
both my father and I are prepared to lose our lives for this work.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.820
Summon Yoshihide!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.820
That man dared to go against my will!

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.610
An eye for an eye!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.320
I'll have him killed!

00:13:29.320 --> 00:13:30.870
The death penalty!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:32.370
What?

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:35.210
You ask me to come?

00:13:36.420 --> 00:13:37.500
Where?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.000
Where are you inviting me from?

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.590
From Hell?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.670
The flames of Hell?

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.640
Who are you?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:52.010
Who is inviting me?

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:55.770
Who?

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:13.910
Hey!

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.250
Hey!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.720
I cannot hear it!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:34.680
I cannot hear the voice of agony!

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.020
This cannot possibly be the figure of a man in pain!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:42.110
The flames that burn a man...

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:45.440
The flames of Hell...

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:55.160
I...

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:01.170
I have yet to see true Hell.

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:11.840
What?

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.300
You cannot paint it?

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:16.430
That is correct.

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:18.270
My.

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:21.480
Have you come to beg for your life, Yoshihide?

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.360
Pitiful.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:25.400
No.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:31.530
This life of mine that may end any second is nothing precious to me.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:33.990
Just...

00:15:34.620 --> 00:15:36.280
Silence, you coward.

00:15:36.790 --> 00:15:43.580
Just one thing exists that I cannot draw without being there myself.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:48.000
I cannot die until I paint that.

00:15:48.380 --> 00:15:51.300
Then what is it that you cannot paint?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:16:01.730
In the center of the mausoleum, I plan to
paint flames even greater than those of Hell.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:05.860
And within the flames...

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:10.190
Within the flames...

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:17.830
a live human screaming in agony as their skin burns.

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:24.330
The figure of a man in agony from both the black smoke and the flames...

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.290
The flaring hair...

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.550
The arms seeking help from the sky...

00:16:29.550 --> 00:16:32.970
The scarlet rain of flames that assault the pure white skin...

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:35.470
I cannot paint any of it!

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:37.390
Please!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:42.480
Please show me flames so large that
they may be compared to a mountain!

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.690
And if it is even possible...

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.860
Whether it is possible or not is hardly the question.

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:04.080
I will do as you have said.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.490
Yoshihide, take a gander.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:41.450
It is the sinful woman who acted against me.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:43.290
I'm sure you remember her quite well.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:51.670
I will set fire to the hay and show you
the flames of Hell right before your eyes.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:18:02.510
Then the woman will certainly have her
bones burned dry and meet a painful end.

00:18:03.100 --> 00:18:06.560
Do not miss her snow-white skin being burned to cinders!

00:18:08.060 --> 00:18:12.230
Glue your eyes to her hair,
burning into the sparks of the flames!

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.990
Light her!

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:27.960
Mitsuki!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:53.860
A sight that may never be seen again for an eternity!

00:19:59.880 --> 00:20:01.170
Mitsuki...

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.050
Father.

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:08.470
Paint me.

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:13.230
Paint me as you see me.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:40.460
No...

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:03.070
Mitsuki!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:05.110
Mitsuki!
